{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'Step 3:', 'bold': True}, {'text': ' On the next page, fill in your Application ID, and click "Search". The status of your application will be displayed in a tabular format: Application ID, Applicant Name, Scheme Applied, Application Status, Remarks, Date, and Time. '}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'Step 4:', 'bold': True}, {'text': ' Once the DLC approves the application, the "Application Status" changes to "Approved". The Applicant can take print of this page by clicking “PRINT” and submit the same at the Labour Office to avail of the scheme benefit.'}]}

{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'Step 01:', 'bold': True}, {'text': ' Application may be submitted online ('}, {'type': 'link', 'link': 'http://webservers.amtron.in/karmaShree', 'children': [{'text': 'http://webservers.amtron.in/karmaShree'}]}, {'text': ') with the recommendations of the competent authority. Deputy Commissioner will be the competent authority to recommend the applications for the officers working in the districts. For the officers working in the Directorate, Commissionerate, or Secretariat, the Director, the Commissioner, and the Sr. most Secretary of the concerned department may recommend the application for the award.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': ''}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'Step 02:', 'bold': True}, {'text': ' All the columns of the application form must be duly filled as per the instructions contained therein.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': ''}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'Step 03:', 'bold': True}, {'text': ' The application for an award in innovation should contain the details of beneficiaries/stakeholders of the initiatives/projects.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': ''}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'Step 04:', 'bold': True}, {'text': ' Application with incomplete/insufficient details shall not be considered.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': ''}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'Step 05: ', 'bold': True}, {'text': 'For an award in innovation, the organization may be represented by the serving Head of the organization or an officer nominated by him/her for receiving the award.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': ''}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'Step 06:', 'bold': True}, {'text': ' A legend should be provided for all abbreviations/acronyms used in the application and documentation.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': ''}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'Note: The following points to be remembered while applying:'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': ''}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': '1.\tThe email address must be “authentic”.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': '2.\tYou will receive an “auto-generated” email to activate your account.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': '3.\tYour email address will be the “User ID” while logging in to the system.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': '4.\tAll the 4(four) sections of the application must be specified properly and correctly.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': '5.\tOne must specify the “Completed Authority” correctly and properly with a valid email address.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': '6.\tThe “Completed Authority” will receive an email to recommend the application from his/her end as mentioned in the guidelines.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': '7.\tThere is a provision to attach Documents (PDFs, JPG images, and Video clips) against each application.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': '8.\tGo for “Final Submit” to complete the application process otherwise it will be considered as incomplete application.'}]}

{'type': 'block_quote', 'children': [{'text': 'Registration:', 'bold': True}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'Step 1: ', 'bold': True}, {'text': 'Visit the '}, {'type': 'link', 'link': 'https://shramadhan.jharkhand.gov.in/home', 'children': [{'text': 'Official website'}]}, {'text': ' of Comprehensive Labour Management System for Factory Establishment / Worker Registration / Inspection / Management & Grievance Redressal; Department of Labour, Employment, Training & Skill Development; Govt. of Jharkhand.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'Step 2:', 'bold': True}, {'text': ' At the top right corner, click "Login". On the pop-up screen, click "Register Here".'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'Step 3:', 'bold': True}, {'text': ' On the next page, a Registration Form will appear. Provide the following mandatory details: First Name, Last Name, Email, and Mobile. Create a Username and a Password. Confirm the Password. Fill in the Captcha Code. Click "Register". Your Mobile Number and Email ID will be verified via One Time Password (OTP). Upon successful verification of the OTP, your registration will be successful. The Login Credentials will be sent to your registered Email ID and Mobile Number.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': ''}]}
{'type': 'block_quote', 'children': [{'text': 'Application:', 'bold': True}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'Step 1:', 'bold': True}, {'text': ' Visit the '}, {'type': 'link', 'link': 'https://shramadhan.jharkhand.gov.in/home', 'children': [{'text': 'Official website'}]}, {'text': ' of Comprehensive Labour Management System for Factory Establishment / Worker Registration / Inspection / Management & Grievance Redressal; Department of Labour, Employment, Training & Skill Development; Govt. of Jharkhand.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'Step 2:', 'bold': True}, {'text': ' At the top right corner, click "Login". Fill in your Username and Password. Click "Login".'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'Step 3:', 'bold': True}, {'text': ' In the ribbon, click "Services > BOC Scheme Benefit > Application Form. On the next page, the "Scheme Benefit Form" (Application Form) will open. '}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'a) In the "Basic Details" section, fill in the mandatory fields (fields ending with a red asterisk mark): BOC Registration Number, Applicant\'s Name, Applicant\'s Father\'s Name / Husband\'s Name, Applicant\'s Date of Birth, Applicant\'s Aadhaar Number, District, Sex.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'b) In the "Select Scheme" section, select the scheme from the list that you wish to apply for.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'c) In the "Upload Section", upload the mandatory documents (those ending with a red asterisk mark) in the specified file size and file type.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': 'Step 4:', 'bold': True}, {'text': ' Finally, click on "Submit Request" to submit your application. On the next page, your "Application ID" will be displayed, confirming the successful submission of the application. Please note down this Application ID for future reference. The Application ID will also be sent to your registered Email ID.'}]}
{'type': 'paragraph', 'children': [{'text': ''}]}
